|\n| $24$ | $1.318$ | $1.711$ | $2.064$ | $2.492$ | $2.797$ |\n| $25$ | $1.316$ | $1.708$ | $2.060$ | $2.485$ | $2.787$ |\n| $26$ | $1.315$ | $1.706$ | $2.056$ | $2.479$ | $2.779$ |" :question/worked-solution "![](images/63/635de7075b0d106ffc2a0f15e65ca7a3406a49945591aa5eae59090c74df1398.png)\n\nDue to the symmetry of the student's $t$-distribution, we have that $P(|X|\\ge x)=0.01$ is equivalent to\n\n$$\n2P(X\\ge x)=0.01\\,⟹\\,P(X\\ge x)=0.005.\n$$\n\nNow, since $X∼{T}_{25},$ we focus on the row of the table that corresponds to $k=25.$\n\n| $k∖p$ | $0.100$ | $0.050$ | $0.025$ | $0.010$ | $0.005$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $24$ | $1.318$ | $1.711$ | $2.064$ | $2.492$ | $2.797$ |\n| $25$ | $1.316$ | $1.708$ | $2.060$ | $2.485$ | $2.787$ |\n| $26$ | $1.315$ | $1.706$ | $2.056$ | $2.479$ | $2.779$ |\n\nFrom this row, we see that\n\n$$\nP(X\\ge 2.787)=0.005.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our answer is $x=2.787.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8b63d849-ac8e-58fe-8d8d-780397c8a283"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8b63d849-ac8e-58fe-8d8d-780397c8a283" :answer-field/id #uuid "8b63d849-ac8e-58fe-8d8d-780397c8a283" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-610f6000-ba93-5b31-be25-ad092c76ffb2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-02dbcaed-89eb-5fb0-b72c-f9dd1752a026" "answer-5b781a62-5301-58de-9505-2d037b1f3b16" "answer-71dcdc44-7b64-5426-8a7d-e4cd03d1e49e" "answer-610f6000-ba93-5b31-be25-ad092c76ffb2" "answer-fd4a7bb1-9caf-57b8-b091-7437f18b4f25"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-02dbcaed-89eb-5fb0-b72c-f9dd1752a026" :answer/id #uuid "02dbcaed-89eb-5fb0-b72c-f9dd1752a026" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1.708" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5b781a62-5301-58de-9505-2d037b1f3b16" :answer/id #uuid "5b781a62-5301-58de-9505-2d037b1f3b16" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2.479