 to ${log}_{3}⁡1=0.$\n\nNote that ${log}_{n}⁡1=0$ for any $n>0,n\\ne 1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-1f10cdcc-3eda-57e1-a376-3057e449f3c3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-1f10cdcc-3eda-57e1-a376-3057e449f3c3" :answer-field/id #uuid "1f10cdcc-3eda-57e1-a376-3057e449f3c3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-23f4ce3d-4f01-5698-89bb-bac48ce52ace" :answer-field/choices ["answer-089b12fd-140f-59f5-a8a5-715dca5123f3" "answer-45bd9db6-bed5-53fb-adb8-ecddcd12ada4" "answer-a8423aab-ff25-5db5-954b-ceedb3aa5c61" "answer-23f4ce3d-4f01-5698-89bb-bac48ce52ace" "answer-d7b6d170-fc89-5ebb-ae6a-d4dd7cbc31d3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-089b12fd-140f-59f5-a8a5-715dca5123f3" :answer/id #uuid "089b12fd-140f-59f5-a8a5-715dca5123f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{log}_{1}⁡0=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-45bd9db6-bed5-53fb-adb8-ecddcd12ada4" :answer/id #uuid "45bd9db6-bed5-53fb-adb8-ecddcd12ada4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{log}_{1}⁡3=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a8423aab-ff25-5db5-954b-ceedb3aa5c61" :answer/id #uuid "a8423aab-ff25-5db5-954b-ceedb3aa5c61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{log}_{3}⁡0=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-23f4ce3d-4f01-5698-89bb-bac48ce52ace" :answer/id #uuid "23f4ce3d-4f01-5698-89bb-bac48ce52ace" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{log}_{3}⁡1=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d7b6d170-fc89-5ebb-ae6a-d4dd7cbc31d3" :answer/id #uuid "d7b6d170-fc89-5ebb-ae6a-d4dd7cbc31d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{log}_{3}⁡1=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-f3941239-6e19-5b0b-909a-0a8f6dea7adb" :question/id #uuid "f3941239-6e19-5b0b-909a-0a8f6dea7adb" :question/math-academy-id "q-108048" :question/problem "${(\\frac{1}{16})}^{1}=\\frac{1}{16}$ can be expressed as" :question/worked-solution "The logarithm of $a$ with base $b$ is defined as follows:\n\n$a={b}^{x}$ is equivalent to ${log}_{b}⁡a=x$\n\nIf we compare ${(\\frac{1}{16})}^{1}=\\frac{1}{16}$ with $a={b}^{x},$ we get $a=\\frac{1}{16},b=\\frac{1}{16}$ and $x=1.$\n\nTherefore, the equation ${(\\frac{1}{16})}^{1}=\\frac{1}{16}$ is equivalent to ${log}_{1/16}⁡(\\frac{1}{16})=1.$\n\nNote that ${log}_{n}⁡n=1$ for any $n>0,n\\ne 1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-226d2ad1-67a7-50c4-9d80-2df4abf628bc"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-226d2ad1-67a7-50c4-9d80-2df4abf628bc" :answer-field/id #uuid "226d2ad1-67a7-50c4-9d80-2df4abf628bc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-b60d526a-7477-5f97-a248-b96dfdb5a1a8" :answer-field/choices ["answer-130dd748-2866-5a43-a676-5219cb240dfc" "answer-b60d526a-7477-5f97-a248-b96dfdb5a1a8" "answer-10b3f0de-10ab-59f8-9482-ea6432ae1a1b" "answer-4eaaec78-93a2-5429-be99-8a6af0db45f6" "answer-45709d79-2399-5b8b-aae1-30eedf29c6f3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-130dd748-2866-5a43-a676-5219cb240dfc" :answer/id #uuid "130dd748-2866-5a43-a676-5219cb240dfc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{log}_{1/16}⁡(\\frac{1}{16})=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b60d526a-7477-5f97-a248-b96dfdb5a1a8" :answer/id #uuid "b60d526a-7477-5f97-a248-b96dfdb5a1a8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{log}_{1/16}⁡(\\frac{1}{16})=1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-10b3f0de-10ab-59f8-9482-ea6432ae1a1b" :answer/id #uuid "10b3f0de-10ab-59f8-9482-ea6432ae1a1b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{log}_{1/16}⁡16=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4eaaec78-93a2-5429-be99-8a6af0db45f6" :answer/id #uuid "4eaaec78-93a2-5429-be99-8a6af0db45f6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{log}_{16}⁡(\\frac{1}{16})=0" :db/