ubtract their imaginary parts.\n\nFor the given problem, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-5+12\\,\\text{i})+(6-9\\,\\text{i}) & =(-5+6)+(12+(-9))\\,\\text{i} \\\\  & =(-5+6)+(12-9)\\,\\text{i} \\\\  & =1+3\\,\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ef3ea9f3-b4bf-5f8d-8b1d-d64fc9e0274e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ef3ea9f3-b4bf-5f8d-8b1d-d64fc9e0274e" :answer-field/id #uuid "ef3ea9f3-b4bf-5f8d-8b1d-d64fc9e0274e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-db45de76-ba75-5058-9e59-6db68de8b937" :answer-field/choices ["answer-db45de76-ba75-5058-9e59-6db68de8b937"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-db45de76-ba75-5058-9e59-6db68de8b937" :answer/id #uuid "db45de76-ba75-5058-9e59-6db68de8b937" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1+3i" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-a8e5bfd0-3749-5d98-b80f-2065e3b9d3d1" :question/id #uuid "a8e5bfd0-3749-5d98-b80f-2065e3b9d3d1" :question/math-academy-id "q-250190" :question/problem "Evaluate the following expression. Use $i$ to denote the imaginary unit.\n\n$(6-4\\,\\text{i})-3=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "Given the complex number $a+b\\,\\text{i},$ $a$ represents its real part while $b$ represents its imaginary part.\n\nTo add or subtract complex numbers, we add or subtract their real parts, and we add or subtract their imaginary parts.\n\nFor the given problem, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(6-4\\,\\text{i})-3 & =(6-4\\,\\text{i})+(-3+0\\,\\text{i}) \\\\  & =(6-3)+(-4+0)\\,\\text{i} \\\\  & =3+(-4)\\,\\text{i} \\\\  & =3-4\\,\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-84cfae3d-dc49-5af3-9269-cc5969182764"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-84cfae3d-dc49-5af3-9269-cc5969182764" :answer-field/id #uuid "84cfae3d-dc49-5af3-9269-cc