05376 :answer-field/choices 17592186105381] [:db/retract 17592186105382 :answer-field/choices 17592186105383] [:db/retract 17592186105382 :answer-field/choices 17592186105384] [:db/retract 17592186105382 :answer-field/choices 17592186105385] [:db/retract 17592186105382 :answer-field/choices 17592186105386] [:db/retract 17592186105382 :answer-field/choices 17592186105387] [:db/retract 17592186105394 :answer-field/choices 17592186105395] [:db/retract 17592186105394 :answer-field/choices 17592186105396] [:db/retract 17592186105394 :answer-field/choices 17592186105397] [:db/retract 17592186105394 :answer-field/choices 17592186105398] [:db/retract 17592186105394 :answer-field/choices 17592186105399] {:db/id 17592186105845 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-925db400-88a9-5795-a4b0-aad7734a8104" "question-05b36d37-a26f-5d16-ae0b-dd50ba7890e6" "question-16fea3d9-04d8-53ba-a81e-4ab7949c02d8"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186105684 :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nFind the derivative of $y = 3\\tanh{x}- \\sinh{x}.$" :question/worked-solution "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nFirst, we recall the results for the derivatives of the basic hyperbolic functions:\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x} ( \\sinh x ) = \\cosh x,\n\\quad \n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x} ( \\cosh x ) = \\sinh x,\n\\quad \n\\dfrac{\\textrm{d}}{\\textrm{d}x} ( \\tanh x ) = \\sech^2 x\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the given function using these results, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x) \\\\  & =3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x) \\\\  & =3{sech}^{2}⁡x-\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186105848 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-49c81891-b661-5bda-b31c-54f1cc0220f3" "question-f4f3ca36-fa30-5fa4-b1a8-a0cc296aaddc" "question-7c706f9d-3f1b-52c2-a133-ccf4032fcc0e" "question-443677a2-c964-52f1-8cf6-218af419b0bb"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186105687 :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nFind the derivative of $f(x) = \\cosh{\\sqrt x}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we express $f(x)$ as a composite function:\n\n$$\nf = \\cosh g, \\qquad g = \\sqrt x\n$$\n\nThe chain rule states that\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}f} {\\textrm{d}x} = \\dfrac {\\textrm{d}f} {\\textrm{d}g} \\cdot \\dfrac {\\textrm{d}g} {\\textrm{d}x}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}f} {\\textrm{d}g}  = \\sinh g,\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}g} {\\textrm{d}x} = \\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt x}.\n$$\n\nFinally, multiplying the two results together and substituting for $g$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x} & =\\operatorname{sinh}⁡g\\cdot \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sinh}⁡\\sqrt{x}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sinh}⁡\\sqrt{x}}{2\\sqrt{x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186105846 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-5de32c1d-3413-5361-b37c-92eba300a033" "question-5d5258aa-0eff-5685-bbfc-832665398ac8" "question-a7015904-a594-5558-b15e-195c0d212c67"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186105685 :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nFind the derivative of $f(x) = 2x\\tanh{x}.$" :question/worked-solution "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nHere, we have the product of two functions $u(x) = 2x$ and $v(x)=\\tanh x.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =(2x)^{′}\\cdot \\operatorname{tanh}⁡x+2x\\cdot (\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x)^{′} \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\operatorname{tanh}⁡x+2x\\cdot {sech}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =2\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x+2x{sech}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =2(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x+x{sech}^{2}⁡x)\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186105847 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-e582897a-43fa-53c9-83f2-0eb49fceb2e4" "question-620df981-8ac1-59e8-bd3d-58c107521764" "question-f50f96cb-b22b-5bd9-91c4-b27ea7e844e6"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186105686 :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nFind the derivative of $w(x) = \\dfrac{x^3}{\\cosh{x}}.$" :question/worked-solution "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nIn this case, the expression for $w(x)$ is a quotient $\\dfrac{u(x)}{v(x)}$ with $u(x) = x^3$ and $v(x) = \\cosh{x}.$ \n\nTherefore, we apply the quotient rule as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{w}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{({x}^{3})^{′}\\cdot \\operatorname{cosh}⁡x-{x}^{3}\\cdot (\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)^{′}}{(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cosh}⁡x-{x}^{3}\\cdot \\operatorname{sinh}⁡x}{{cosh}^{2}⁡x} \\\\  & =\\frac{{x}^{2}(3\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x-x\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)}{{cosh}^{2}⁡x}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-925db400-88a9-5795-a4b0-aad7734a8104" :question/id #uuid "925db400-88a9-5795-a4b0-aad7734a8104" :question/math-academy-id "q-95674" :question/problem "$$\n\nFind the derivative of $y=\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the results for the derivatives of the basic hyperbolic functions:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x)=\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x,\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x)=\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x,\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x)={sech}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the given function using these results, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sinh}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-14d5db5c-02d3-5b2c-b27c-ac3d6f3cb6ed"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-14d5db5c-02d3-5b2c-b27c-ac3d6f3cb6ed" :answer-field/id #uuid "14d5db5c-02d3-5b2c-b27c-ac3d6f3cb6ed" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-7e2af0f0-a818-54d9-b56d-5228585449fe" :answer-field/choices ["answer-e6717f7c-2154-5695-905e-b3451522c467" "answer-80281663-e94f-539d-9b79-950c750311f6" "answer-7e2af0f0-a818-54d9-b56d-5228585449fe" "answer-fe09c074-c5d7-5c62-88d6-9836961da553" "answer-5576b01a-9d1c-5313-b50a-e30808c3d5e6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e6717f7c-215